<obfl xmlns="http://www.daisy.org/ns/2011/obfl" version="2011-1" xml:lang="en">
	<meta xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">
		<dc:title>Volume keep with previous test</dc:title>
		<dc:description>One short block is one sheet. The block with keep-with-previous-sheets="2" fills sheets 4-5.
		Without the keep, the volumes would be 4 and 3 sheets, and volume 2 would start with the block's last sheet.
		The keep applies to the end of the block, but only to the block's own sheets: sheet 4 is kept with sheet 5,
		sheet 3 is not. So the volumes are 3 and 4 sheets.</dc:description>
	</meta>
	<layout-master name="body" page-width="10" page-height="6" duplex="false">
		<default-template>
			<header/>
			<footer/>
		</default-template>
	</layout-master>
	<volume-template sheets-in-volume-max="4">
		<pre-content/>
		<post-content/>
	</volume-template>
	<sequence master="body">
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block keep-with-previous-sheets="2">⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
	</sequence>
</obfl>
